Subject: [PATCH 063/119] dt-bindings: soc: samsung: exynos-sysreg: Add
 Exynos9810 FSYS1 sysreg

The FSYS1 system registers hold the PCIe PHY lane configuration
(stock DT sysreg@11410000, PCIe "sysreg" at 0x11411044).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml   | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml
index 28f914592..d69931a05 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml
@@ -37,6 +37,7 @@ properties:
               - samsung,exynos8895-peric1-sysreg
               - samsung,exynos9810-chub-sysreg
               - samsung,exynos9810-cmgp-sysreg
+              - samsung,exynos9810-fsys1-sysreg
               - samsung,exynos9810-peric0-sysreg
               - samsung,exynos9810-peric1-sysreg
               - samsung,exynos990-peric0-sysreg
